{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Notre créativité oubliée !","Ce film liant poésie, témoignages et performances artistiques pose un regard novateur sur notre créativité et les fabuleuses possibilités de notre cerveau. Il met en lumière les freins qui l’ont bridés et tous les atouts apportés par une sollicitation à tout âge de nos facultés créatives. L’éveil de la créativité est un antidote à la violence. Avec Albert Jacquard, Catherine Vidal et Jacques Salomé.",[4],"high rank employment",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":24,"media":26,"synopsis":29,"production":30,"characters":33,"roles":34,"awards":66,"tags":3},"Film","FR2015_187","fr2015-187-notre-creativite-oubliee",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2015-01-01",2015,"Documentary",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":23},"Étienne Gary","etienne-gary",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[25],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":27,"trailerUrl":28},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/49/86/153137/format_page/notre-creativite-oubliee.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U2r-Ul7KtUw",{"native":2,"english":10},[31],{"country":22,"share":32},"Majority coproducer",[],[35,43,50,56,62],{"person":36,"role":42},{"id":37,"slug":38,"name":37,"birthYear":39,"deathYear":40,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":41},"Albert Jacquard","albert-jacquard",1925,2013,[],"Documentary subject",{"person":44,"role":42},{"id":45,"slug":46,"name":45,"birthYear":47,"deathYear":20,"gender":48,"nationality":22,"awards":49},"Catherine Vidal","catherine-vidal",1951,"Female identifying",[],{"person":51,"role":42},{"id":52,"slug":53,"name":52,"birthYear":54,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":55},"Christophe Delvallé","christophe-delvalle",1958,[],{"person":57,"role":42},{"id":58,"slug":59,"name":58